        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thanduk matdä ruaacni rɛy ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt thanduk matdä ruac kuɔth käp, cukɛ jɛ kap kä Ɛ-bɛn-e-dhɛr naŋ jɛ kä Ac-dod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ka̱n, kä cua naŋ ni duëël kuɔth Da-gon. Cua jɛ ben la̱th gekädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ Ac-dod rɔ jiɛc mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ kɛ runwaŋ, nɛnɛ jɛ, Da-gon cɛ tɛɛth cɛ nhiamdɛ yiath piny nhiam thandukä matdä ruac Kuɔth Nhial. Cukɛ Da-gon ka̱n kä cua luɔc gua̱a̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ rɔ jiɛc mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ kɛ runwaŋ, cukɛ Da-gon nɛnɛ, cɛ tɛɛth kɛ nhiamdɛ piny nhiam thandukä matdä ruac Kuɔth Nhial, kä wi̱c Da-gon kɛnɛ te̱tkɛ da̱ŋ rɛw cikɛ töl puɔ̱ɔ̱nydɛ tekɛ piny rɛy döör. Cu duɔth ni puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn /ci bööth Da-gon kɛnɛ nɛy tëë ci coth duëël Da-gon kä Ac-dod jäl do̱o̱r Da-gon mäni walɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tet Kuɔth Nhial thiak ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ji̱ Ac-dod, kä cuɛ kɛ jak kä dual, kä cuɛ kɛ duäc kɛ muɔ̱c ji̱ Ac-dod kɛ dhok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Ac-dod ɛ nɛn i̱ te ŋɔak inɔ, cukɛ wee i̱, “/Ci thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi duɔth kɛ kɔ. Kɛ ɣöö tet Kuɔth cɛ thiak ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ kɔ kɛ Da-gon kuothda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cukɛ naath ja̱k kä cua Kua̱r ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt diaal mat guäth kɛl, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Ɛŋu mi ba̱kɔ lät kä thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl?” Kä cu kua̱r kɛ loc i̱, “A thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nööŋkɛ kä Gɛ̈th.” Cua thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl naŋ ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä min ci kɛn ɛ nööŋ, cu Kuoth Nhial wec duäc, kɛ muɔ̱cdiɛn riɛk mi di̱i̱t. Cuɛ ji̱ wec moc kɛ dhok, nɛy ti di̱t amäni gaat, cuɛ kɛ moc kɛ dhok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cukɛ thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth jäk kä Ɛk-ron, kä cu ji̱ Ɛk-ron wiee i̱, “Cikɛ kɔn nöŋ thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɔn ben näk mäni nɛɛkɔn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cukɛ kua̱r ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt diaal cɔl guäth kɛl, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Wuɔcɛ thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, luɔcɛ jɛ guäthdɛ, kɛ ɣöö /cɛ nɛy bi lɛ näk kɛ nɛɛkɔ kɛɛl.” Kɛ ɣöö näk juey naath rɛy wec kɛɛliw. Ci tet Kuɔth thiak thi̱n ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy tin /Ken li̱w tekɛ dhok ti di̱t, cu wiee wec pal ni pua̱a̱r",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
